; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; background-color: rgb(171, 242, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-&nbsp; 2025학년도 겨울</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">계절수업은&nbsp; 정해진 수강료납부기간(12.1 ~12.3</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, 3일간)외에는&nbsp;</span></b></span><b style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">수강료 추가납부기간이 운영되지 않으니,&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">반드시 기간 내 수업료를 납부완료하기 바랍니다.</span></b></span><b style=\"font-size: 1rem; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(미납시 수강취소됨)</span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; background-color: rgb(171, 242, 0);\"><font color=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- 2 과목 수강신청시 1 과목만&nbsp; 수강취소 불가</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(2과목 수강신청자가 1과목수업료만 납부할 경우 2과목 모두 수강취소됨)</span><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 1rem;\"></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 정원 외 수강신청 기간을 참고하여&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">수강신청을 완료하여주시기&nbsp;바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">.(추후 수강신청 불가)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"19069\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><table width=\"1041px\" style=\"width: 1041px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &qu